@* Compact header shown on touch tablets/phones (AppConfig.media.touchCompact), where the sidebar becomes an
   off-canvas drawer: [menu] Yazılım Envanteri [account]. The account slot shows the current user
   from AppConfig.currentUser - the app has no authentication yet, so there is deliberately no
   Login/Logout action here; this is where it plugs in once sign-in exists. *@
<header class="mobile-header" data-mobile-header>
    <button type="button" class="menu-toggle" data-sidebar-toggle aria-label="Menüyü aç/kapat" aria-expanded="false">
        <span data-icon="menu" data-icon-size="20"></span>
    </button>

    <a class="mobile-header-title" href="/">Yazılım Envanteri</a>

    <div class="user-wrap mobile-header-account">
        <button type="button" class="user-block" data-dropdown-trigger="mobileUserMenu" aria-label="Hesap menüsü">
            <span class="avatar avatar-sm" data-user-initials></span>
            <span class="user-name mobile-header-user-name" data-user-name></span>
        </button>
        <div class="dropdown-panel" id="mobileUserMenu">
            <div class="dropdown-user">
                <span class="user-name" data-user-name></span>
                <span class="user-role" data-user-role></span>
            </div>
            <span class="dropdown-item dropdown-item--muted">Oturum yönetimi bu sürümde kullanılamıyor.</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
